{"seq":11,"slug":"ecommerce-recommendation","title":"电商推荐系统","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.39,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 电商推荐系统 简介\n\n推荐系统是电商平台的核心竞争力之一，它通过对用户行为数据的深度分析和算法建模，在海量商品中为每位用户精准匹配最有可能感兴趣的商品，从而提升用户体验和平台转化率。从亚马逊的\"购买此商品的客户也购买了\"到抖音的个性化商品信息流，推荐系统已经渗透到电商购物的每一个环节。\n\n本知识库面向具备一定技术背景的电商从业者和算法工程师，系统讲解电商推荐系统从原理到落地的全链路知识。无论你是希望理解推荐系统底层逻辑的产品经理，还是需要构建推荐引擎的工程师，都能在这里找到实用的参考。\n\n第1章**推荐基础**从推荐系统的整体架构出发，介绍推荐系统的核心组成、用户行为建模方法以及推荐效果的评估指标体系，帮助读者建立对推荐系统的全局认知。\n\n第2章**商品推荐算法**深入讲解三大主流推荐算法范式：协同过滤、基于内容的推荐以及深度学习推荐模型，涵盖从经典方法到前沿技术的演进脉络。\n\n第3章**推荐场景**聚焦电商平台中最关键的推荐触点，分别探讨首页推荐、商品详情页推荐、购物车与结算页推荐的差异化策略和实现方案。\n\n第4章**推荐优化**围绕推荐系统的持续迭代展开，涵盖A/B测试方法论、冷启动问题的解决策略以及实时推荐系统的架构设计。\n\n建议读者先通读第1章建立基础认知，再根据自身角色选择深入方向：算法工程师可重点研读第2章，产品和运营人员可侧重第3章和第4章的场景与优化实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rec-fundamentals","title":"推荐基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rec-system-overview","title":"推荐系统概述","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-fundamentals/rec-system-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"user-behavior-modeling","title":"用户行为建模","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-fundamentals/user-behavior-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rec-evaluation-metrics","title":"推荐系统评估指标","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-fundamentals/rec-evaluation-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-rec-algorithms","title":"商品推荐算法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/product-rec-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤推荐","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/product-rec-algorithms/collaborative-filtering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-based-rec","title":"基于内容的推荐","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/product-rec-algorithms/content-based-rec"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning-rec","title":"深度学习推荐模型","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/product-rec-algorithms/deep-learning-rec"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rec-scenarios","title":"推荐场景","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-scenarios","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"homepage-rec","title":"首页推荐策略","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-scenarios/homepage-rec"},{"seq":2,"slug":"detail-page-rec","title":"详情页推荐策略","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-scenarios/detail-page-rec"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cart-checkout-rec","title":"购物车与结算页推荐","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-scenarios/cart-checkout-rec"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"rec-optimization","title":"推荐优化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ab-testing-rec","title":"推荐系统 A/B 测试","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-optimization/ab-testing-rec"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cold-start-problem","title":"冷启动问题","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-optimization/cold-start-problem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"real-time-rec","title":"实时推荐系统","url":"/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-recommendation/rec-optimization/real-time-rec"}]}]}